{"articleNo":"226322","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=226322&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 위니아딤채 UCC공모전 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.07.01","hit":"10144","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBgjAnA9CDsUA0B2AHANgdwCJqQZwBUAhALwAsA5AMwQHUBxWhAOgHMBLKoA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>[공모전 추가 특전사항]</strong></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">재학생 입상 시, 추후 대유위니아(7月 이후부터 위니아딤채 사명변경) 공채 입사지원시 1차 서류전형에 가산점 부여</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">※ 재학생 기준 : 공모전 접수 마감일까지(~8/4), 학교에 재학 중인 학생</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>[공모전 기획의도]</strong></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">7월 1일 회사 사명 변경에 따른 회사 인지도와 가치를 높일 수 있는 UCC 공모전 개최</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ 사명 변경 : 대유위니아 → 위니아딤채</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>[공모주제]</strong></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">새롭게 출범하는 위니아딤채의 인지도와 가치를 높일 수 있는 영상콘텐츠</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><u><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">종합가전브랜드 “WINIA”와 김치냉장고브랜드”딤채” 를 연관 지어 우리 회사를 영상으로 소개</span></u><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">해주세요.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;여러분에게 위니아딤채가 종합가전브랜드 “WINIA”와 부동의 김치냉장고브랜드 1위인 ”딤채”를 보유하고 있는 기업으로</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;알려지길 원합니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 여러분의 멋진 아이디어를 기다립니다.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong><br></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>[공모일정]</strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- 공지 : 7/1</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- 접수 : 7/22 ~ 8/4</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>[공모전 안내 홈페이지]</strong></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 120%; font-family: Malgun Gothic; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- </span><a href=\"https://www.winiadimchae.com/event/event_view.jsp?EVENT_SEQ=578\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.winiadimchae.com/event/event_view.jsp?EVENT_SEQ=578\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">https://www.winiadimchae.com/event/event_view.jsp?EVENT_SEQ=578</span></font></u></strong></span></a><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">​</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
